graph TD
    POS[POS Client]
    GQL[Apollo Gateway]
    ID[Identity Service]
    CART[Cart Service]
    CACHE[Inventory Cache (Redis)]
    SAP[SAP ECC]
    KAFKA[Order Event Bus (Kafka)]

    POS -->|GraphQL/HTTPS| GQL
    GQL -->|JSON/HTTPS| ID
    GQL -->|JSON/HTTPS| CART
    GQL -->|RESP/TCP| CACHE
    GQL -->|API / integration fallback only| SAP

    KAFKA -. warms cache async .-> CACHE
    SAP -. publishes inventory changes via integration/event feed .-> KAFKA

    CART -. publishes cart/order events .-> KAFKA

    %% Transitive dependency interpretation:
    %% POS depends directly on Apollo Gateway,
    %% and transitively on Identity Service, Cart Service, Inventory Cache,
    %% plus SAP ECC on cache miss and Kafka for warm-cache freshness.
